Cell["\<\
Includes two spin components for each orbital, giving dimensions 8 for sp and \
18 for spd. The s-orbital spin block is zero.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->666847371,ExpressionUUID->"3399ca1b-807b-fd45-87ea-5494298954f6"],

Cell["\<\
The orbital ordering matches SlaterKosterHoppingBlock; each orbital is \
followed immediately by its two spin components.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1948427160,ExpressionUUID->"514be77f-e122-6848-a334-c7866595fa54"],

Cell["\<\
The supplied p and d coefficients multiply the explicit orbital matrices \
tensored with Pauli spin matrices. Choose the coefficients according to this \
convention when comparing with a convention that writes spin as PauliMatrix/2.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1549895328,ExpressionUUID->"e22c2797-164c-c145-8d29-ac50291ded6b"]
}, Closed]],

